        "message": "Stage 9 records: B3 passed, v3.2 installed (U112–U123) (#18)\n\nB1′–B3 and installation records only: ROADMAP rows with actual exit codes,\nunsure.md U112–U123, results/stage9/{b1prime-0001, b2prime-dry-run-0001,\nb3-0001, v32-install-0001}, the reviewed B3 wrapper v2 and the token store\nhelper. Dry-run proof listings stay in the Actions artifact (.gitignore);\ndigests are in artifacts.json. No protected files. No credential.\n\nCo-authored-by: mack-dot <235131950+mack-dot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
